---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Random Chat — Talk to Strangers Online Free | Airwalk" description="Free random chat with strangers. Voice or text, no signup, no camera. Connect instantly with people worldwide on Airwalk.">
	<header class="bg-canvas/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-hairline h-14 flex items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-8 sticky top-0 z-40">
		<a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-ink"><svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2z"/></svg><span class="font-extrabold text-lg uppercase">Airwalk</span></a>
		<a href="/chat" class="bg-primary hover:bg-primary-deep text-on-primary font-semibold text-sm py-2 px-5 rounded-lg transition-colors">Start Random Chat</a>
	</header>
	<main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink">Random Chat with Strangers</h1>
		<p class="text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">Looking for a random chat site that actually works? Airwalk connects you with real people from around the world instantly — by voice or text. No signup, no camera, no coins. Just click and start talking.</p>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">How Random Chat Works on Airwalk</h2>
		<ol class="list-decimal pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
			<li><strong>Choose your mode</strong> — Voice chat for real conversations, or text-only for typing</li>
			<li><strong>Set your filters</strong> — Pick language, country, and interests (all free)</li>
			<li><strong>Get matched instantly</strong> — Our system pairs you with a random stranger in seconds</li>
			<li><strong>Chat, play games, add friends</strong> — Have fun and build connections</li>
		</ol>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Why Airwalk is the Best Random Chat Site</h2>
		<ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate space-y-2">
			<li>100% free — gender, country, and interest filters all included at no cost</li>
			<li>No registration required — start chatting in under 5 seconds</li>
			<li>Voice or text — choose how you want to connect</li>
			<li>5 in-call games — break the ice with Tic-Tac-Toe, Wordle, and more</li>
			<li>Anti-spam — 20-second skip cooldown keeps bots out</li>
			<li>Friends system — save great connections and reconnect later</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Random Chat FAQ</h2>
		<div class="space-y-3">
			<details class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4"><summary class="font-bold text-ink cursor-pointer">Is random chat on Airwalk free?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">Yes, completely free. No coins, no premium, no subscriptions.</p></details>
			<details class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4"><summary class="font-bold text-ink cursor-pointer">Is it safe to random chat with strangers?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">Yes. Airwalk is voice-only (no camera), has report/block tools, and uses a 20-second anti-spam cooldown.</p></details>
			<details class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4"><summary class="font-bold text-ink cursor-pointer">Do I need to create an account?</summary><p class="text-sm text-slate mt-2">No. You get an anonymous identity automatically. No email or phone needed.</p></details>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-primary rounded-xl p-8 text-center space-y-3">
			<h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-on-primary">Ready for a Random Chat?</h3>
			<a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors">Start Now — Free</a>
		</div>
	</main>
	<footer class="border-t border-hairline py-8 px-4 text-center text-xs text-steel"><p>© 2025 Airwalk. <a href="/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Home</a> · <a href="/voice-chat" class="text-primary hover:underline">Voice Chat</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">Privacy</a></p></footer>
</Layout>
